@Iris.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5006
@devUser = admin@iris.local

### Service identity (anonymous)
GET {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### Health probe (anonymous)
GET {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Who am I — identity + effective permissions (global scope)
GET {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/me
X-Dev-User: {{devUser}}
Accept: application/json

### Who am I — evaluated at a customer scope
GET {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/me?customerId=c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
X-Dev-User: {{devUser}}

### Who am I — evaluated at a context scope (Contoso / Production)
GET {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/me?customerId=c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&contextId=c0000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a3
X-Dev-User: marco@contoso.example

### Customers visible to the caller
GET {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/customers
X-Dev-User: gio@globex.example

### Role catalog — requires governance.roles.manage (403 for gio, 200 for admin)
GET {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/governance/roles
X-Dev-User: {{devUser}}

### Permission catalog — any authenticated user
GET {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/governance/permissions
X-Dev-User: gio@globex.example

### Users and their role assignments — requires governance.read
GET {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/governance/users
X-Dev-User: {{devUser}}

### Register a customer — requires governance.customers.manage
POST {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/customers
X-Dev-User: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "northwind", "name": "Northwind Traders" }

### Add a context to a customer — requires governance.customers.manage
POST {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/customers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/contexts
X-Dev-User: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Production", "kind": "Production" }

### Assign a role to a user at a scope — requires governance.assignments.manage
POST {{Iris.Api_HostAddress}}/governance/users/d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005/assignments
X-Dev-User: {{devUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roleKey": "reader", "scopeType": "Customer", "customerId": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }
